#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Run the first R2 GPU-hybrid decode continuation smoke.

The binary generated by this tool uses CPU prefill to build live SSM/KV state,
then evaluates one continuation token through the GPU layer fragments already
closed by the bring-up ladder. Router top-k and LM-head top-k stay on CPU for
this first token-emitting lane; the artifact is diagnostic evidence, not a
speedup claim.
"""

